Z||000006||PearlBlueSoul||12-03-2000||07:02 PM||||Well, I never said we were perfect.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>I duno, it also is some of the social aspect, because normally people in rare segments of the automotive scene tend to be very knowledgeable and intellectual when it comes to discussing their car (shame to say that's not Always true, perfect example is my home board unfortunatley).  This sometimes can be our downfall too, because we have so much knowledge of our cars and have some scope on what they can and can't do.  To have someone diss them in such a broad and intense way just set us all off (me included, directed towards the person who came on our boards a week later).  What really helped fuel the fire was when someone came on our boards and started talkin smack to all of us in general.  so...I duno.  All I can say is, I guess, we're sorry?<P>Just kidna hoped you wouldn't take that personal.  And that's true what people are saying about the newbies.  your board is much more established than our own.  Matter of fact, the board you see now was only started in july after someone hacked our original setup, which was started sometime in either april to may.  We're just now starting to have rough times, and while I feel it may never be perfectly smooth, I would like to do as much resurfacing as I can.  Keep it smooth, or bring it back to where it was.<P>All this to say, that I appologize as a veteran of the MR2pages BBS.  I hope that means something, even if you still harbor anger/resentment towards us.  We're not all like that, but we do have buttons that will cause that reaction if pushed too hard.<P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.atlantamr2s.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/darionscard</A>  <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">       <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.||||reg||1
