Z||000011||PearlBlueSoul||12-04-2000||04:02 PM||||Hey, glad to hear it man.  <P>Seriously, we're not all bad.  Just, some of the Amateurs got to that thread before we vets had a chance to put a word in edgewise.  Hence why that thread is now locked down because it started to become pointless.  (gotta love being a moderator) I asked admin to shut it down because of that and he agreed.  Matter of fact, put up the last post, "This thread is locked because it has become a pointless flaming war", or something to that effect.<P>Seriously tho, thanks for the comments.  I shouldn't wish you to get a bad impression of all of us when a discern few caused a stirr and felt the need to fuel the fire.  Most of us are much more tame than that, and I'm sure I'll eventually see some of that calamity on this board sometime.  But I'll know better than you guys to all be like that.  <P>C ya lates man.  Take it easy.||||reg||1
